sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Consumer User
    participant App as React SPA
    participant Auth as Supabase Auth (bcrypt)
    participant Edge as Supabase Edge Functions
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (RLS)

    User->>App: Submits email & password on /auth/login
    App->>Auth: signInWithPassword({ email, password })
    Auth->>Auth: Verifies bcrypt password hash (work factor >= 10)
    Auth-->>App: Issues JWT Access Token (TTL: 60m) & Refresh Token
    Note over App: Stores JWT in memory / secure state

    User->>App: Requests protected analysis history (/history)
    App->>Edge: GET /api/v1/analysis/history (Bearer JWT)
    Edge->>Auth: getUser(jwt) -> verifies signature
    Auth-->>Edge: Returns verified user claims (auth.uid = usr_123)
    
    Edge->>DB: SELECT * FROM scan_results (Scoped with auth.uid context)
    Note over DB: PostgreSQL kernel checks RLS:<br/>USING (auth.uid() = user_id)
    DB-->>Edge: Returns User's isolated rows only
    Edge-->>App: 200 OK (Paginated history payload)
    App->>User: Renders history timeline

    alt Malicious Cross-Tenant Tampering Attempt
        User->>App: Manages to forge request for other user's scanId
        App->>Edge: GET /api/v1/analysis/:otherUserScanId (Bearer JWT)
        Edge->>DB: Query for scanId under caller's auth.uid()
        DB-->>Edge: 0 rows returned (RLS blocked)
        Edge-->>App: 404 Not Found (Zero disclosure)
    end
